  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HKSjwdn/Living-Things.jpg\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> <strong>Добавляет в Minecraft множество новых мобов, чтобы мир казался более живым</strong> </span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">Информация о мобах и предметах в игре предоставляется через мод <strong>Patchouli</strong> (от Vazkii)&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">скачать здесь</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">(не обязательно, но <strong>настоятельно рекомендуется</strong>)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Этот мод доступен для Forge, Fabric (начиная с 1.18.2) и NeoForge (начиная с 1.20.4). Проверьте вкладку файлов, чтобы увидеть все версии мода.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Версия для Fabric требует наличие Fabric-API </span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">получить его здесь</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">Подробную информацию о мобах и предметах можно найти на <strong>вики</strong>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">нажмите здесь</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Для просмотра изображений в игре перейдите в галерею</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\" rel=\"nofollow\">Слон</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\" rel=\"nofollow\">Жираф</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Лев</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Акула</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Пингвин</a></strong> </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PShrSK2/x170-elephant.png\" alt=\"Elephant\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/d4v4Vk38/x170-giraffe-1.png\" alt=\"Giraffe\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VWPR0c5y/x170-lion.png\" alt=\"Lion\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9kGxr6Mk/x170-shark.png\" alt=\"Shark\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z6SkjYSc/x170-penguin.png\" alt=\"Penguin\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\" rel=\"nofollow\">Страус</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Фламинго</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\" rel=\"nofollow\">Краб</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скат</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Енот</a></strong> </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z12Wtz4W/x170-ostrich.png\" alt=\"Ostrich\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/n8nRjdgs/x170-flamingo.png\" alt=\"Flamingo\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zhPLtBkR/x170-crab-red.png\" alt=\"Crab\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4n7jGDDL/x170-mantaray-blue.png\" alt=\"Mantaray\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/YBndBzHc/x170-raccoon.png\" alt=\"Raccoon\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\" rel=\"nofollow\">Сова</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\" rel=\"nofollow\">Древний Блейз</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\" rel=\"nofollow\">Коала</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\" rel=\"nofollow\">Улитка</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\" rel=\"nofollow\">Обезьяна</a></strong> </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ymP9Qjbv/x170-owl-brown.png\" alt=\"Owl\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/CpW4Kx6c/x170-ancient-blaze.png\" alt=\"Ancient-Blaze\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9k24KZsm/x170-koala.png\" alt=\"Koala\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dJ1vdgjq/x170-snail-blue.png\" alt=\"Snail\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/99FHb035/x170-monkey.png\" alt=\"Monkey\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Рыцарь Незера</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\" rel=\"nofollow\">Шруми</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Морской конёк</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Дракон Эндера (младенец)</a></strong> </span></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\" rel=\"nofollow\">Павлин</a></strong> </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/q3F0xV3H/x170-nether-knight.png\" alt=\"Nether-Knight\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rK4xbM0p/x170-shroomie-red.png\" alt=\"Shroomie\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/27R8skfB/x170-seahorse-blue.png\" alt=\"Seahorse\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TD4RGbsB/x170-baby-ender-dragon.png\" alt=\"Baby-Enderdragon\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tGS4jmy/x170-peacock.png\" alt=\"Peacock\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> Если у вас есть вопросы по поводу мода или вы хотите узнать немного больше о будущих функциях: </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> Не стесняйтесь присоединиться к моему&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"> </a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ссылке</a> </span></p>",
